## Build on a new computer

Use Node.js 22.12 or newer. After writing ALL the files below, run:

```sh
npm install
npm run assets
npm run build
npm run dev
```

The asset script downloads and verifies the exact media with SHA-256 before saving it into this new project. Keep these filenames: the source uses them. If a URL fails, report that URL; do not invent substitute media. Oswald, TASA Orbiter and Inter are bundled as verified font assets with licenses. No backend or payment service is supplied: preserve the reference's existing demo interactions.

## Check the result

Compare with the screen recording at its original aspect ratio, then at 390×844, 768×1024 and 1440×900. Check complete scene/section order, fonts, media loading, forward/reverse interactions, reduced motion, autoplay fallback, resize and horizontal overflow. Do not add new sections, statistics, decorative labels or other UI absent from the source.

